.","limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Create a Python 3.11+ environment on Linux or macOS and run pip install minigrid.","Import minigrid and gymnasium; create MiniGrid-Empty-8x8-v0 and call reset(seed=0).","Use RGBImgPartialObsWrapper for agent-view RGB; RGBImgObsWrapper reveals the full grid. Record the wrapper, mission-text access, actions, terminated and truncated separately.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Compare seeded door-and-key success rates with a fixed action budget.","Modify an environment rule, then check reset, observations and goal completion.","Test BabyAI instructions while withholding hidden map state.","AI use and evaluation boundary","Built for agent research. Preserve license notices; explicitly separate rendered pixels, symbolic observations and mission text in each evaluation.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Pinned RGB visibility and wrapper implementation","https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid/blob/7f5853792ea7f04f75614661006d87fcf949f26d/minigrid/wrappers.py","Observation wrappers","https://minigrid.farama.org/api/wrappers/","Installation and BabyAI tasks","https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid#readme","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":103},"https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid/blob/main/LICENSE","Terms category","Open-license sources","terms","provenance","Asset license","Use bundled procedural grid rendering; added images and datasets need their own provenance.","assetLicense","Code license","Apache-2.0 in the current repository.","codeLicense","Get started",[117],"access",{"_54":118,"_25":119,"_120":121},"Free Python package","https://minigrid.farama.org/","note","Install minigrid locally; no commercial game or model API is required.","Primary source",[125],"sourceUrl",{"_54":122,"_25":126},"https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid"